#right_[B"H]

#right_[Sunday, 27 Sivan 5785]

#vspace(amount: 1em)

To the honoured
#bold[Rabbi Shimon ben David shlit"a]
Rosh Yeshiva, Yeshivas Ohr HaChochma
14 Rechov HaRav Kook, Jerusalem

#vspace(amount: 1.5em)

#h2[Re: Application to the advanced program]

Dear Rebbe shlit"a,

#indent_[
After wishing the Rosh Yeshiva and his family well, I am writing to ask whether
I might join the advanced limud program in the yeshiva. I have heard from a
number of talmidim about the ruchniyus in the beis medrash and about the depth
of the derech halimud there, and I would very much like to learn in that
environment.
]

I have been learning in Yeshivas Nachalas Yisroel for #bold[three years], and in
that time I finished all of seder #italic[Moed] b'iyun. I would now like to push
further, and to do that I am asking to learn under the Rosh Yeshiva.

#vspace(amount: 0.5em)

I would be grateful for a reply at the Rosh Yeshiva's convenience, and if an
interview is needed I am happy to come at any time that suits.

#vspace(amount: 1em)

#indent_[
With berachos for continued hatzlacha in harbotzas haTorah,
#hrule
#bold[Yaakov ben Avraham Rosenberg]
Telephone: 054-123-4567
]
